Pursuant to Regulation 30 and other applicable Regulations of the SEBI (Listing Obligations and Disclosure Requirements) Regulations, 2015 and with reference to the captioned subject, we hereby inform that, the Board of Directors, at its meeting held today i.e. Saturday 14th November, 2026, along with other businesses, has inter-alia considered and approved the;

1. Unaudited Financial Results of Company for the Second Quarter and Half Year ended on 30th September, 2026 together with the Limited Review Reports of Statutory Auditors of the Company as per Regulation 33 of SEBI (LODR) Regulations, 2015.

A copy of the Unaudited Financial Results along with the Limited Review Report is enclosed herewith.
